 na.\nYou are inside the path\, 21 km from its centre line: the star vanish
 es for up to 3.5 s.\nClosest approach 00:32:18 IST\, give or take 7 s. The
  star is 16° up in the SW · dark sky.\nIt fades 2.5 magnitudes for up to
  7.2 s on the centre line\, and the path is 28 km wide\, give or take 24 k
 m.\nFinder chart\, the map and the path as KML: https://occult.alokm.com/a
 steroids-2027-08#2027-08-10-321-florentina-933504
